  "details": "The idea is you can limit the game audio and normalize it at a certain decibel level. So you don't have to adjust the Player Voice and World Audio. So You can always hear your friend's voice over the world audio without needing to adjust the volume every time in different world with different world audio. Also can be an option to normalize every player voice so if some players are soft or too loud you don't have to click and change a lot. \n\nAlso a way to prevent people blasting audio in their microphone using Soundpad like audio input.",
